    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.4522247314453,
        373.5399169921875,
        270.6822204589844
      ],
      "text": "without drug-resistance detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.77313232421875,
        526.9853515625,
        292.91815185546875
      ],
      "text": "A new class of low-complexity manual NAATs (LC-mNAATs) has now emerged for alternative",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.27313232421875,
        527.0029907226562,
        308.41815185546875
      ],
      "text": "molecular solutions that have improved accuracy when compared with smear microscopy and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.77313232421875,
        526.9700927734375,
        323.91815185546875
      ],
      "text": "very basic infrastructure, power and equipment requirements (e.g. heat block). LC-mNAATs can",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.2731018066406,
        526.7174072265625,
        339.4181213378906
      ],
      "text": "be performed at the microscopy level and are currently cheaper than other molecular tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.7731018066406,
        527.0064086914062,
        354.9181213378906
      ],
      "text": "Collectively, these characteristics are useful for testing in constrained settings. However, like smear",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.952597618103027,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.2731018066406,
        526.69384765625,
        370.4181213378906
      ],
      "text": "microscopy, this class of tests does not incorporate rifampicin-resistance detection and therefore",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986091613769531,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
